``` PHP or Web Server Process Writes Executable Script or Per-Directory Config to Web Root (Windows) ```
``` Sigma id: e4ae4b72-d043-4906-ab1d-d7cfe24ed018 | level: medium | status: experimental ```
``` Target: Splunk SPL - CIM Endpoint data model (tstats); needs CIM-mapped EDR/Sysmon data ```
``` Generated by tools/build_rules.py - UNTESTED, review field names before use. ```
| tstats summariesonly=false allow_old_summaries=true fillnull_value="null" count min(_time) as firstTime max(_time) as lastTime from datamodel=Endpoint.Filesystem where Filesystem.process_path IN ("*php-cgi.exe", "*php.exe", "*httpd.exe", "*w3wp.exe") Filesystem.file_path IN ("*\\inetpub\\*", "*\\htdocs\\*", "*\\www\\*", "*\\wwwroot\\*") Filesystem.file_path IN ("*.php", "*.phtml", "*.phar", "*.aspx", "*.ashx", "*\\.user.ini", "*\\.htaccess", "*\\web.config") by Filesystem.dest Filesystem.file_create_time Filesystem.process_path Filesystem.process_guid Filesystem.process_id Filesystem.file_path | `drop_dm_object_name(Filesystem)` | convert timeformat="%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S" ctime(firstTime) | convert timeformat="%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S" ctime(lastTime) 
